        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "8a0afa92-ef6d-3282-95fe-77a2fa3e59ec",
                "word": "réquisition",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "77c3507c-05d6-40cb-9f2a-6a2ec945ebc2",
                        "entry_id": "8a0afa92-ef6d-3282-95fe-77a2fa3e59ec",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "réquisitions"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "998c7710-8376-31e8-9222-18acf6744948",
                        "entry_id": "8a0afa92-ef6d-3282-95fe-77a2fa3e59ec",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Action de requérir."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Administration"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c4e3097f-896a-4802-a935-f090f29215d9",
                                "sense_id": "998c7710-8376-31e8-9222-18acf6744948",
                                "text": "Le texte qui nous est proposé pour l'article 231-54 reprend cette disposition en ajoutant, après les mots : « soit sur réquisition du ministère public », les mots : soit à la demande d'une des parties »."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0b4aa762-db0c-36ed-8e89-9d86b5552a38",
                        "entry_id": "8a0afa92-ef6d-3282-95fe-77a2fa3e59ec",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ordre que donne l’autorité publique de mettre à sa disposition des personnes ou des choses."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2cca4fb7-b1ad-4206-8e3c-1fc049801878",
                                "sense_id": "0b4aa762-db0c-36ed-8e89-9d86b5552a38",
                                "text": "Ce malheureux arrondissement est dans un état déplorable pour pouvoir répondre à aucune réquisition. Il est même impossible que les troupes qui y sont cantonnées, tant dans les villes que dans les campagnes, cavalerie et infanterie, puissent y subsister encore six jours en arrachant même la dernière ressource du cultivateur."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc4b23e2-8bb9-4781-8618-e99ddc053abf",
                                "sense_id": "0b4aa762-db0c-36ed-8e89-9d86b5552a38",
                                "text": "On eut besoin d'un million de soldats ; la réquisition y pourvut."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "26faccf8-48bd-4321-8b33-13044ea742ec",
                                "sense_id": "0b4aa762-db0c-36ed-8e89-9d86b5552a38",
                                "text": "La Première ministre, Élisabeth Borne, a annoncé, mardi, la réquisition du personnel nécessaire à la réouverture des deux dépôts d’ExxonMobil toujours bloqués, même après l’accord salarial trouvé lundi avec les deux syndicats majoritaires."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "35621a38-527e-4ad6-9b22-b8af73555d83",
                                "sense_id": "0b4aa762-db0c-36ed-8e89-9d86b5552a38",
                                "text": "Un matin les gendarmes venaient dire qu'on était de réquisition : il fallait trousser son paquet et suivre les autres recrues. Aller se faire casser les os, Dieu sait où, au diable au vert."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "07457dd3-6063-47b4-a78e-dec005deba33",
                                "sense_id": "0b4aa762-db0c-36ed-8e89-9d86b5552a38",
                                "text": "Au Tchad, nous changerons nos chevaux de réquisition (qui sont d’insignes rosses) et nos bêtes de somme contre des chameaux pour continuer notre route dans la zone désertique d'Agadem."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c9583d9b-ee26-49c1-9983-03be68b0d473",
                        "source_entry_id": "8a0afa92-ef6d-3282-95fe-77a2fa3e59ec",
                        "source_sense_id": "998c7710-8376-31e8-9222-18acf6744948",
                        "source_sense_description": "Action de requérir",
                        "target_lang_word": "requisition",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "requisition",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "81b3a648-128d-3be6-9a56-9ccbe48a690f",
                                        "entry_id": "97ba296e-6225-36f7-9eb8-dfffaf806615",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A formal request for something.",
                                            "A formal demand made by one state or government upon another for the surrender or extradition of a fugitive from justice."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18ead764-e42f-4aa5-aa9b-888f302b1fdc",
                                                "sense_id": "81b3a648-128d-3be6-9a56-9ccbe48a690f",
                                                "text": "the surrender of fugitives , by authorizing the Governor , in his discretion , on requisition from a foreign government , to surrender up fugitives charged with murder , forgery , larceny , or other crimes[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "529c37ee-0e1b-30a3-9bf4-8fef52e55341",
                                        "entry_id": "97ba296e-6225-36f7-9eb8-dfffaf806615",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A formal request for something.",
                                            "A notarial demand for repayment of a debt."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c47244ed-6b0e-4ce4-b12a-a54c503f830e",
                                                "sense_id": "529c37ee-0e1b-30a3-9bf4-8fef52e55341",
                                                "text": "a requisition used upon an infeftment of annual rent"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2111f54c-d5fe-3612-bc09-6e3139dfe080",
                                        "entry_id": "97ba296e-6225-36f7-9eb8-dfffaf806615",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A formal request for something.",
                                            "A formal request by a doctor or other clinician, usually on a standardized form, for specific medical tests or procedures to be performed on a patient by a third party, such as a laboratory or imaging center"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d479224b-146f-41df-a3d8-0e22182af768",
                                                "sense_id": "2111f54c-d5fe-3612-bc09-6e3139dfe080",
                                                "text": "a lab requisition for blood tests"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6053ab77-2740-3d87-9c33-6ad441b8f806",
                                        "entry_id": "97ba296e-6225-36f7-9eb8-dfffaf806615",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A formal request for something.",
                                            "A demand by the invader upon the people of an invaded country for supplies, as of provision, forage, transportation, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4e95a3b-49a6-49e0-85c2-6e2fa83e8754",
                                                "sense_id": "6053ab77-2740-3d87-9c33-6ad441b8f806",
                                                "text": "It was the policy of the American army to procure voluntary labor whenever possible, but a sufficient number of volunteers was frequently not obtainable. In such cases, a requisition for additional labor was served on German civil officials."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2260e00-1dd5-4f92-8731-3899324eeff2",
                                                "sense_id": "6053ab77-2740-3d87-9c33-6ad441b8f806",
                                                "text": "First, a civilian settlement is not a “need of the occupying army” for which requisition is permitted."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de884b50-b402-4409-81a8-e8dd5ef0b16c",
                                                "sense_id": "6053ab77-2740-3d87-9c33-6ad441b8f806",
                                                "text": "To the extent the law of occupation permits the confiscation or requisition of property, taking control of cyber infrastructure or systems is likewise permitted."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d0ac9952-5363-3c59-953a-440775994a0d",
                                        "entry_id": "97ba296e-6225-36f7-9eb8-dfffaf806615",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A formal request for something.",
                                            "A formal application by one officer to another for things needed in the public service."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fab1adc3-7d39-4785-ae56-717c1a002975",
                                                "sense_id": "d0ac9952-5363-3c59-953a-440775994a0d",
                                                "text": "a requisition for clothing, troops, or money"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f0108802-0fae-3730-ad35-2761c1457d06",
                                        "entry_id": "97ba296e-6225-36f7-9eb8-dfffaf806615",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That which is required by authority; especially, a quota of supplies or necessaries."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "60f24994-7c1b-396c-be13-48def9f653a6",
                                        "entry_id": "97ba296e-6225-36f7-9eb8-dfffaf806615",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A call; an invitation; a summons."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42b28a16-3356-48e1-9b68-341751cee7e7",
                                                "sense_id": "60f24994-7c1b-396c-be13-48def9f653a6",
                                                "text": "a requisition for a public meeting"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7dd89860-2ef5-4bbb-9c4b-a174ee3be3c8",
                                                "sense_id": "60f24994-7c1b-396c-be13-48def9f653a6",
                                                "text": "Amid the many mirrors called into requisition by Lady Townshend's fête, not one gave back a lovelier likeness than that which reflected the face and form of Lady Marchmont."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "requisition",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2dfd03cc-82da-310c-bb90-a6f305003048",
                                        "entry_id": "b9efff60-bebf-3916-9bf5-579c41aa1903",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To demand something, especially for a military need of staff, supplies, or transport."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2423c24f-f691-4ecb-b031-7730bbf4eb07",
                                                "sense_id": "2dfd03cc-82da-310c-bb90-a6f305003048",
                                                "text": "The 1,000-year-old village was requisitioned in the 1960s, first in a reforestation plan and then as an army training ground. The Castilla-La Mancha regional government accuses Fraguas Revive of illegally occupying the site, which lies within a natural park."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
